      </div><div class="delivery-card"><h3>DELIVERY & AUTHENTICITY</h3><div class="delivery-info"><svg><use href="#truck"/></svg><div><strong>Inside Dhaka</strong><span>Cash on delivery available.</span></div></div><div class="delivery-info"><svg><use href="#truck"/></svg><div><strong>Outside Dhaka</strong><span>Advance payment; shipping charges apply.</span></div></div><div class="delivery-info"><svg><use href="#shield"/></svg><div><strong>Authentic quality</strong><span>Selected premium football jerseys.</span></div></div></div></aside>
    </section>
    <section class="recommendations" id="recommendations"><div class="container"><div class="reco-heading"><div><h2>Complete your line-up.</h2><p>More jerseys worth a place in your collection.</p></div><a class="back-link" href="/#arrivals">Shop all <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="reco-grid" id="recoGrid"></div></div></section>
